                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal align=center><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 18pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">筑梦一中<SPAN lang=EN-US>|</SPAN>我校<SPAN lang=EN-US>2019</SPAN>年信息学（机器人方向）项目特长生招生开始啦！<SPAN lang=EN-US><?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">绍兴一中作为全国信息学培训基地学校和浙江省教育机器人应用试点示范建设学校，全面响应国务院下发的《新一代人工智能发展规划》，积极开展信息学、机器人竞赛并取得了显著成绩。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">根据绍兴市教育局相关文件规定，我校按照“公正、公平、公开”原则，开展<SPAN lang=EN-US>2019</SPAN>年特长生招生工作。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 黑体">一、招生计划</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">（一）招生人数：<SPAN lang=EN-US>6</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=fontstyle01><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">人。</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">（二）招生项目：信息学（机器人方向）项目特长生招生</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 黑体">二、报名条件</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">初三应届毕业生，思想品德优秀，行为端正、身心健康、学习习惯好、有团队精神，在初中阶段，获得以下条件之一：</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312" lang=EN-US>1.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">全国青少年科技创新大赛创新成果获省级二等奖及以上获得者；</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312" lang=EN-US>2.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">“明天小小科学家”奖励活动省级二等奖及以上获得者；</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312" lang=EN-US>3.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">参加由教育主管部门、科技主管部门举办的机器人竞赛中获得省二等奖及其以上，且为主力队员（参赛项目需在高中组设置国赛级别）；</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312" lang=EN-US>4.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">胸怀远大志向，有强烈的家国情怀，对信息学和人工智能有浓厚的兴趣，有一定学科特长和主动创新思维的<SPAN lang=EN-US>2019 </SPAN>届优秀初中毕业生</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 黑体">三、报名程序</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312" lang=EN-US>1.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">报名组织。符合报名条件的考生填写《绍兴市第一中学信息学（机器人方向）特长生报名表》（见学校官网），并将纸质报名表、初中各学期期中期末成绩及排名、相关荣誉证书复印件（上述材料加盖初中学校公章）、身份证或户口本复印件，于<SPAN lang=EN-US>2019</SPAN>年<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>22</SPAN>日前交至绍兴市第一中学教学处（地址：绍兴市站前大道<SPAN lang=EN-US>1898</SPAN>号，树兰楼<SPAN lang=EN-US>2014</SPAN>室，联系人：周文龙老师；联系电话：<SPAN lang=EN-US>18906858234</SPAN>），材料不齐者不予受理。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: blue; FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312" lang=EN-US>2.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">资格审查。报名后，学校负责审核考生资格，向市教育局报备后，将结果于<SPAN lang=EN-US>2019</SPAN>年<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>23</SPAN>日在绍兴市第一中学官网上公布。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 黑体">四、测试<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312" lang=EN-US>1.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">时间：<SPAN lang=EN-US> 2019</SPAN>年<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>25</SPAN>日上午<SPAN lang=EN-US>8</SPAN>：<SPAN lang=EN-US>30---11</SPAN>：<SPAN lang=EN-US>30</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312" lang=EN-US>2.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">地点：绍兴市第一中学</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312" lang=EN-US>3.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">测试内容分两部分：</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">（一）信息学（机器人）素养测试（<SPAN lang=EN-US>20%</SPAN>）；现场完成指定任务并打分，满分<SPAN lang=EN-US>100</SPAN>分。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">（二）科学素养测试（<SPAN lang=EN-US>80%</SPAN>）；该项测试内容为初中数学、科学学科知识，卷面满分<SPAN lang=EN-US>100</SPAN>分。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">两部分测试成绩按比例相加为测试总成绩。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 黑体">五、录取办法<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
