<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt">五、注意事项：</SPAN><FONT face=Calibri><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US> </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 0.05pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US>1. </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">考生考试当天早上在</SPAN><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt">绍兴一中西门</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">（站前大道</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US>1898</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">号），<B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal">凭身份证或户口簿进校</B>，接送的家长一律在校门外等候，私家车在校门外有序停放。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 0.05pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US>2.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 14pt">考生于<SPAN lang=EN-US>8:00</SPAN>在考场（</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋">树兰楼<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN>楼<SPAN lang=EN-US>5002</SPAN>室</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 14pt">）门口集中抽签，凭身份证或户口本有序进入考场，在与签号相对应的座位号位置进行</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">科学素养测试；信息学（机器人）素养测试</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 14pt">顺序也按该签号顺序进行，<SPAN lang=EN-US>8:15</SPAN>以后停止进场</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 0.05pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US>3.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">信息学（机器人）素养测试</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 14pt">用的</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋">调试电脑由学校提供，不允许自带电脑，考生自备完成任务所需的器材、调试用数据线等，禁止携带<SPAN lang=EN-US>U</SPAN>盘等存储工具，一经发现，取消测试资格。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 0.05pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US>4.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 14pt">学校一楼食堂提供<SPAN lang=EN-US>15</SPAN>元<SPAN lang=EN-US>/</SPAN>份（两荤两素）中餐<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>考生可自愿就餐。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT size=5> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
    
